<title>JAPAN: Fujimi -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujimi -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.27		vs	    8.60</p>
<p> Operating	    2.35		vs	    1.82</p>
<p> Current		2.38		vs	    1.75</p>
<p> Net		    1.14		vs	  937    million</p>
<p> EPS		   94.39 yen	  vs	   85.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujimi Inc is a maker of silicon wafer polishing materials.</p>
